    "text": "1 days ago Spots are Going Fast — Since we announced opening registration for IBPI Connect just two weeks ago, a third of the spots have already been claimed! It’s going to be a big year in Kansas City as BTA celebrates their 100th anniversary, and it will be an experience you will not want to miss. Happening August 31 – September 2 at The Westin Kansas City at Crown Center, this is your chance to meet with more than two dozen of IBPI’s vendor partners in-person to learn about the latest products and services and keep your dealership ahead of the game. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
